1. Clean-Room Provenance & Independent Architecture
========================================================================

JobHunt Crew is an independently developed, clean-room software system
created from first principles.

The architecture, event engine, data structures, and agent specifications
contained in this repository were authored cleanly without copying,
adapting, or incorporating source code or assets from restricted or
proprietary third-party systems.

Specifically:
- Restricted third-party repositories, including "job-hunt-copilot"
  (personally licensed) and "Job-Ops" (licensed under the Commons Clause),
  were strictly isolated and quarantined. No source code, text, or
  materials from those repositories were viewed, accessed, or copied during
  the development of this project.
- Provenance and originality are deterministically enforced using automated
  clean-room shingle fingerprint checking (SHA-256 hash sets of normalized
  token sequences), verifying zero unauthorized textual overlap.

