4. Zero Personal Identifiable Information (PII) Commitment
========================================================================

All names, contact details, career histories, employer profiles, and metrics
contained within repository fixtures, golden benchmarks, integration tests,
and documentation examples are entirely fictitious (e.g., "Dr. Morgan Vance",
"Alex Rivera"). Any resemblance to actual persons, living or dead, or real
organizations is entirely coincidental.

User-specific candidate data, credentials, and identity tokens reside
strictly on the user's local machine in uncommitted, gitignored files
and are never transmitted to external SaaS or centralized database stores.
